{"sourceUrl":"https://sky.cpu.edu.cn/b9/85/c13324a244101/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:09.088758+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://sky.cpu.edu.cn/b9/85/c13324a244101/page.htm","html":"<div><p><a href=\"https://sky.cpu.edu.cn/b9/85/c13324a244101/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>根据《中国药科大学</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span><span><span>年接收推免生（含直博生）预报名通知》（药大研函〔</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span><span><span>〕</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>34</span></span><span><span><span><span>号）等文件精神，生命科学与技术学院现开展第二批次接收推免生预报名及复试工作，相关工作通知如下。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>一、接收第二批次推免生报名专业目录</strong></span></span></span></span></p><center><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span><strong>类别</strong></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><strong>专业代码</strong></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><strong>专业</strong></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><strong>方向</strong></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>专硕</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>0860</span></span></span><span><span>00</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>生物与医药</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>10</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>基因治疗与核酸药物</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>专硕</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>105</span></span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span>00</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>药学</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>10</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>生物药物发现与转化</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></center><p><span><span><span><span><span><strong>二、报名方式</strong></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>有意参加且预计获得推荐免试资格的全国各院校</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span><span><span>届应届本科毕业生可在</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>日至</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>15</span></span><span><span><span><span>日上午</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>0</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>：</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>00</span></span><span><span><span><span>登录我校推免生预报名系统（</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>http://yzs.cpu.edu.cn/logon</span></span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>,</span></span><span><span><span><span>如实填写各项信息并提交材料。报名项目选择“推免生预报名”，并按提示上传报名材料。学院对申请人资格进行审核，并于</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>0</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>点前向入围的学生在系统中发送通知，未收到通知者即未入选，不再另行通知。收到通知学生请在接到通知后</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span><span><span>小时内登录系统确认</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>并申请加</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>QQ</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>群（群号：</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>973463162</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>，备注真实姓名和学校），群内发布复试相关通知，请注意查看</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><strong>三、报名条件</strong></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>、具有良好的思想品德和政治素质，遵纪守法，身心健康。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>、全国高校</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span><span><span>届应届本科毕业生，所学专业为药学类、中药学类、化学类、生物科学类、化工与制药类、生物医学工程类、生物工程类、基础医学类、食品科学与工程类等相关专业，且预计可获得所在高校免试推荐资格。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span><span><span>、身体健康状况符合教育部等部门制定的《普通高等学校招生体检工作指导意见》。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span><span><span>、学习成绩优异，学术研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力，具有相应研究生培养潜质。在校期间曾参加科学研究、全国学术竞赛等活动表现突出者，及具有代表性科研成果者优先考虑。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span><span><span>、同一学院同一批次内限填报</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>个硕士志愿，考生不得在同一学院同一专业重复报名参加复试。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><strong>四、复试安排</strong></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://sky.cpu.edu.cn/b9/85/c13324a244101/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>、复试时间：拟定于</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>17</span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>-1</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>8</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>日期间进行，具体安排</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>QQ</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>群内</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>通知，请随时关注。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>、复试形式：线上面试</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>腾讯会议</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span><span><span>、考核内容及要求：</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span> （1）<span><span><span><span>学生准备</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>分钟左右自我介绍（以</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>PPT</span></span><span><span><span><span>形式介绍个人情况及本科期间学习及科研经历）</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span> （2）<span><span><span><span>专家提问，考核内容包括学生专业基础能力、外语能力、综合素质能力等。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>提醒：请考生准备好本人身份证，以备面试时评委老师进行身份查验。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>复试期间，请考生保持手机网络畅通，一直不上线、并联系不上者，视为放弃本次复试。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>考核复试前，考生需将《中国药科大学</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span><span><span>年推荐免试研究生诚信复试承诺书》（见附件）签字版扫描件发给群内考核组秘书老师。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>第二</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>批次</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>报名复试结果由学校审核后系统内发布。</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>复试通过的学生，需将</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>《中国药科大学考生思想政治表现、自然情况审查表》盖章签字版原件于</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>10</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>日前寄送至以下地址：南京市江宁区龙眠大道</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>639</span></span><span><span><span><span>号中国药科大学</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>生科院</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>办公室（江宁校区实验楼</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>G</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>05</span></span><span><span><span><span>），</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>许</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>老师，</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>025-86185</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>397</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>（只能使用顺丰快递，不可使用其他快递，快递面单上详细标明“政审表”）。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><strong>五、联系方式</strong></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>学院网站地址：</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>https://</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>sky</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>.cpu.edu.cn/</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>邮箱：</span></span></span></span></span><a href=\"mailto:miaolp@cpu.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span><span>xujuan</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>@cpu.edu.cn</span></span></span></a></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><strong>重点提醒：</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span>申请我校推荐免试研究生的</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span><span><span>年应届本科毕业生，</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>在全国推免服务系统开放后，仍须在该系统中注册并填报志愿，并根据实际进程完成接收、确认复试、待录取通知等相应程序。</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span>届时请关注我校研究生招生网和中国研究生招生信息网的通知。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>附件:<img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://sky.cpu.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_pdf.gif\"/><a href=\"https://sky.cpu.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/60/2d/7f7c69274c3392e8e401016fb584/d55e3db9-5923-4e9a-aadd-e16633d80ab6.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"6、中国药科大学2027年推荐免试研究生诚信复试承诺书.pdf\">6、中国药科大学2027年推荐免试研究生诚信复试承诺书.pdf</a></span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>中国药科大学</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>生命科学与技术学院</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"528cbbf36001250092f8b2fd00ac3a39e8eafe21896ea1d2067db954241c09e2","textLength":1421,"sourceSha256":"616dd381330b1b39fef19a874cb00d7c91596f4427a31937dc306da45067592b","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-07131e9421a95483c307","title":"2026年中国药科大学生命科学与技术学院2027年接收推免生预报名（第二批次）通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:09.088758+00:00"}
